  "agent_notes": [
    "Normal TLS requests failed with the exact managed-proxy error 'self signed certificate in certificate chain'; curl --insecure was then used only for public GET requests to the expected NIRF and official MNNIT hostnames.",
    "Both supplied NIRF 2025 government listings contain the exact institution name with Prayagraj, Uttar Pradesh.",
    "The central PG catalogue is explicitly marked valid for academic year 2020-21, and its linked detailed M.Tech catalogue is dated 2017. The current admissions page lists programme families and admission routes but does not provide a complete current M.Tech specialization catalogue, so the record remains manual_review.",
    "The UG page lists B.Tech degree-course names together with first-year curriculum subjects and a duplicate curriculum-version entry; only degree programmes were imported. The official About Us page also says nine B.Tech. and nineteen M.Tech. programmes, which conflicts with the newer UG page list and reinforces the catalogue gap.",
